# Global Context for Claude Code

## About Me
- Name: [Your Name]
- Role: [Your role / what you do]
- Location: [City, Country]

## Communication Style

- Direct, no fluff
- Challenge my assumptions when appropriate
- Lead with conclusion, then supporting reasoning
- Keep it actionable

## Working Principles
- [Your key principles — e.g., "Data-driven decisions", "Bias for action"]

## What I Never Want
- Generic advice — be specific to my context
- Summaries of what you just did — show results, not narration
- Asking permission for read operations — just read and act

## Date Awareness
Always run `date +%Y-%m-%d` at the start of any task involving dates.
Never assume the date — verify.

